Overview

Successfully deployed and configured DBA Dash, a centralized SQL Server monitoring and performance analysis solution, for the MGE (Madison Gas and Electric) environment in Madison, Wisconsin. 
The implementation provides real-time monitoring, health checks, performance metrics, and proactive alerting for SQL Server infrastructure.

Objectives
Centralize SQL Server monitoring.
Monitor server health and performance.
Track database growth and utilization.
Identify blocking, deadlocks, and long-running queries.
Provide historical performance analysis.
Improve troubleshooting and capacity planning.
Environment
Component	DetailsMonitoring Tool	DBA Dash
